> Does the buc status of tins have any effect on it telling me what's in  
> it? (I only remember I shouldn't eat cockatrice tins, but if I don't  
> know what's in it... I also vaguely remember something about a message  
> of "This smells of". Do I get that every time? Is there some chance of  
> the wrong or a too vague smell?

I think you may be remembering Slash'EM here.  In vanilla Nethack, as
others have mentioned, you will always be told exactly what's in a tin
unless you are hallucinating.  In Slash'EM, however, you will only
reliably recognise the smell of monsters you have already eaten.
Anything else will either give you a message indicating the class of
monster only e.g. "it smells kind of like dog or other canine" or just
"the smell is unfamiliar".
